//! The vector dispatcher: call a function by name with its inputs flattened (SI). Generated by tools/pcode.py from the pseudocode (trinetra-pcode/2); do not edit.
#![allow(unused_mut, unused_variables, unreachable_code, clippy::all)]

/// The outputs, flattened, or None when there is no such function or too few inputs.
